.3; §6.1; §6.3"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Table 5.1; Definition 6.4; Theorem 6.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"207–208; 271; 278"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"231–232; 295; 302"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"923be44c9742df37\" href=\"?note=923be44c9742df37\" title=\"27-df-quadfunc\">27-df-quadfunc</a>）和书中 Horn DNF 约定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuadHorn}_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n\\cap\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QuadHorn}_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n\\cap\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按原书 §5.3 的 quadratic Horn 类解释；Horn 采用每项至多一个负文字的 DNF 约定，因而是 FALSE 点 meet-closure，不能使用 TRUE 点 meet-closure 替换。这里通过两个已定义函数类的交集给出接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-quadfunc","status":"resolved","id":"923be44c9742df37","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-quadfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":